---
// Accreditation pill, same logos and wording as the AHC hero on hijrahcoach-website (MyBrain MiND Accredited + ICF CCE).
// Logos supplied by Daru, used as-is, served as lossless PNG at 2× their CSS size.
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import mind from "../assets/accred/mind-accredited.png";
import cce from "../assets/accred/icf-cce.png";
---
<div class="mc-accred">
  <span class="logos">
    <Image src={mind} alt="MyBrain MiND Accredited Program" widths={[72, 144]} sizes="72px" format="png" />
    <Image src={cce} alt="ICF Continuing Coach Education (CCE)" widths={[72, 144]} sizes="72px" format="png" />
  </span>
  <p>Program Micro-Credential COA diakreditasi internasional oleh <b>ICF (International Coaching Federation) CCE</b> dan <b>MyBrain MiND Accredited Program</b></p>
</div>

<style>
  .mc-accred { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-inline: auto; padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem 0.7rem 0.7rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; background: #fff; text-align: left; max-width: 720px; }
  .logos { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; flex: none; }
  .mc-accred :global(img) { width: 64px; height: 64px; flex: none; object-fit: contain; }
  .mc-accred p { margin: 0; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .mc-accred b { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 700; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .mc-accred { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; border-radius: 18px; padding: 1rem; } .mc-accred :global(img) { width: 56px; height: 56px; } }
</style>
